# samples/09-DraftsHistoryAudit – start it with: dotnet run --project samples/09-DraftsHistoryAudit
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5109
@admin = {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/endpoints
@prices = {{admin}}/0199c0de-0000-7000-8000-000000000001

### Revision 2 is live
GET {{baseUrl}}/prices/ANV-1

### The drafts
GET {{admin}}/drafts

### The draft of GET /prices/{sku}
GET {{prices}}/draft

### What publishing would change
GET {{prices}}/draft/diff

### Publish it – as alice
POST {{prices}}/publish
X-User: alice

### Revision 3: price 15 and a currency parameter
GET {{baseUrl}}/prices/ANV-1?currency=PLN

### The history, newest first
GET {{prices}}/revisions

### One revision
GET {{prices}}/revisions/1

### Differences between two revisions
GET {{prices}}/diff?from=1&to=2

### Roll back to revision 1 – as bob (a new revision, history stays)
POST {{prices}}/revisions/1/rollback
X-User: bob

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/prices/ANV-1

### Draft a new endpoint, scheduled in 30 seconds (change publishAt to a time a bit ahead of now)
POST {{admin}}/drafts
Content-Type: application/json
X-User: alice

{
  "definition": { "method": "GET", "route": "/flash-sale", "processor": "response", "processorConfig": { "body": { "off": 50 } } },
  "publishAt": "2030-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "comment": "Flash sale"
}

### 404 until it's published
GET {{baseUrl}}/flash-sale

### The audit log
GET {{admin}}/audit

### …of one endpoint, or filtered
GET {{admin}}/audit?user=alice&limit=20

### Scheduled for two minutes after the first start
GET {{baseUrl}}/promo
